<!-- ======================================
     Projects Page - Introduction
     ====================================== -->

<section class="mb-5">

  <p class="text-uppercase fw-bold mb-2"
     style="color: var(--portfolio-teal);">
    My Work
  </p>

  <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">
    Featured Projects
  </h1>

  <p class="lead">
    Here are some of the projects I have worked
    on during university, high school, and
    independent learning.
  </p>

  <p>
    These projects have helped me develop skills
    in networking, programming, cybersecurity,
    and problem-solving.
  </p>

</section>

<!-- ======================================
     Projects - Bootstrap Responsive Grid
     ====================================== -->

<section class="mb-5"
         aria-labelledby="projects-heading">

  <h2 id="projects-heading" class="h3 mb-4">
    Explore My Projects
  </h2>

  <div class="row g-4">

    <!-- Project 1: Desktop Security App -->
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">

      <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">

        <div class="card-body p-4">

          <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved fa-2x mb-3"
             style="color: var(--portfolio-teal);"></i>

          <h3 class="card-title h5">
            Desktop Security App
          </h3>

          <p class="card-text">
            A personal project where I am building
            a desktop application that checks a
            computer for common security problems.
            It scans the system, monitors important
            files for changes, and logs its findings.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-2">
            <strong>Technologies:</strong>
            JavaScript, Electron
          </p>

          <p class="mb-0">
            <strong>What I Learned:</strong>
            How common security issues can appear
            on a real computer system.
          </p>

        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- Project 2: Cisco Network Setup -->
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">

      <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">

        <div class="card-body p-4">

          <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired fa-2x mb-3"
             style="color: var(--portfolio-teal);"></i>

          <h3 class="card-title h5">
            Cisco Network Setup
          </h3>

          <p class="card-text">
            A final networking project where I
            configured a network using Cisco
            routers and switches. I assigned IP
            addresses, configured network devices,
            and tested connectivity.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-2">
            <strong>Technologies:</strong>
            Cisco routers and switches
          </p>

          <p class="mb-0">
            <strong>What I Learned:</strong>
            How to plan, configure, and
            troubleshoot a computer network.
          </p>

        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- Project 3: Hangman Game -->
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">

      <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">

        <div class="card-body p-4">

          <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal fa-2x mb-3"
             style="color: var(--portfolio-teal);"></i>

          <h3 class="card-title h5">
            Hangman Game in Python
          </h3>

          <p class="card-text">
            A Hangman game developed in Python
            for my Introduction to Programming
            course. The player guesses letters
            to identify a hidden word before
            running out of attempts.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-2">
            <strong>Technologies:</strong>
            Python
          </p>

          <p class="mb-0">
            <strong>What I Learned:</strong>
            Programming loops, conditional
            statements, and user input handling.
          </p>

        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- Project 4: Gravity and Roller Coasters -->
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">

      <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">

        <div class="card-body p-4">

          <i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high fa-2x mb-3"
             style="color: var(--portfolio-teal);"></i>

          <h3 class="card-title h5">
            Gravity and Roller Coasters
          </h3>

          <p class="card-text">
            A high school physics project
            exploring how gravity affects
            roller coaster motion, including
            how height influences speed
            while moving up and down hills.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-2">
            <strong>Concepts:</strong>
            Gravity, potential energy,
            kinetic energy
          </p>

          <p class="mb-0">
            <strong>What I Learned:</strong>
            How potential energy transforms
            into kinetic energy during motion.
          </p>

        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- Project 5: Trie Autocomplete -->
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">

      <article class="card h-100 shadow-sm">

        <div class="card-body p-4">

          <i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch fa-2x mb-3"
             style="color: var(--portfolio-teal);"></i>

          <h3 class="card-title h5">
            Trie Autocomplete in Python
          </h3>

          <p class="card-text">
            A Standard Trie data structure
            implemented in Python for my
            Data Structures and Algorithms
            course. The program finds stored
            words matching a provided prefix.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-2">
            <strong>Technologies:</strong>
            Python, Trie data structures
          </p>

          <p class="mb-0">
            <strong>What I Learned:</strong>
            How tree-based structures support
            efficient prefix searching.
          </p>

        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

